<title>BRAZIL: Brazil starts CVRD auction.</title>
<headline>Brazil starts CVRD auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rio de Janeiro bolsa announced the start of the auction of up to 45 percent of voting shares of Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD).</p>
<p>A bolsa official said CVRD shares were suspended for the auction.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Rio newsroom 55-21-5074151))</p>
